      "writtenOn": "2026-10-08T00:48:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e we don\u0027t strictly align with ARM everywhere else anyway.\n\nAs I see it, the fact that we currently implement our own implementation of page ownership management instead of using the same code on both ARM and x86 is a temporary situation, and eventually (at least for upstream) we should share this code with ARM instead of reimplementing/duplicating the same (inherently mostly arch-independent) logic. We are not there yet, but in the meantime, it seems a good idea to at least  minimize unnecessary divergences in the _design_ this code implements.",
      "parentUuid": "e36e1c44_0eb1293e",
